# Code Owners.
#
# Branch protection must have "Require review from Code Owners" enabled for any of this
# to bind. GitHub silently ignores an entry whose team has no access to this repository,
# so confirm each team below is granted at least Write access under
# Settings -> Collaborators and teams. An invalid entry fails open.
#
# CODEOWNERS uses LAST-MATCH-WINS: the final matching line decides the owner.
#
# A pull request author never satisfies their own Code Owner review, so every protected
# path is owned by more than one person. That is deliberate: a control only one person can
# approve is a control that gets bypassed the week they are on leave.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default owner for everything in the repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*                           @neotree/core-devs

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Security controls.
#
# These are the paths the trusted PR gate blocks on. Both teams are listed so either can
# approve: core-devs for the engineering context, maintainers for organisation oversight.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/security/                  @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers
/.github/workflows/         @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers
/.github/actions/           @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers
/.gitattributes             @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers
/.semgrepignore             @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers

# Package-manager execution configuration. These files can run code at install time.
/.npmrc                     @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers
/.yarnrc                    @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers
/.yarnrc.yml                @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers
/.pnpmfile.cjs              @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers
/pnpm-workspace.yaml        @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Organisation-level governance. Maintainers listed first as the primary owner.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.github/CODEOWNERS         @neotree/maintainers @neotree/core-devs
/.github/dependabot.yml     @neotree/maintainers @neotree/core-devs
/SECURITY.md                @neotree/maintainers @neotree/core-devs
/LICENSE                    @neotree/maintainers

